WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.889 --> 00:00:02.320
It's out.

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:06.720
Can you believe it's been 10 years
since How Not to Die came out?

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:13.324
Million copies sold, translated into
three dozen different languages.

00:00:13.324 --> 00:00:15.680
And now, newly updated,

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:19.920
added all the juicy new research
that's been published in the last decade.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:24.560
So, perfect new year,
new you present to yourself.

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:27.104
Perfect stocking stuffer
for anyone in your life.

00:00:27.104 --> 00:00:30.560
If you want to live a
longer, healthier life.

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:34.320
And all money I receive
from the sales of all my books,

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:36.400
including this one and all the others,

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.266
goes directly to charity.

